#: backend/dbm_aiagent/agent/constants.py:21
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"你现在是一个风险报告比对分析师。请判断以下两份风险报告是否描述的是**同一个风"
"险问题**。\n"
"\n"
"## 判断标准\n"
"- 如果两份报告的**核心风险点相同**（比如都在说CPU负载高、都在说磁盘空间不"
"足），即使措辞不同、数值略有差异、时间区间不同，也视为**相同风险**。\n"
"- 如果两份报告描述的是**不同类型的风险问题**（比如一个说CPU高、另一个说磁盘不"
"足），则视为**不同风险**。\n"
"- 如果某份报告包含了新的风险点（即使同时也包含旧的风险点），也视为**不同风险"
"**。\n"
"\n"
"## 上一次风险报告\n"
"{last_report}\n"
"\n"
"## 本次风险报告\n"
"{current_report}\n"
"\n"
"## 输出要求\n"
"只需要输出一个JSON，不要输出其他内容：\n"
"- 相同风险：{{\"is_same_risk\": true, \"reason\": \"简短说明原因\"}}\n"
"- 不同风险：{{\"is_same_risk\": false, \"reason\": \"简短说明原因\"}}\n"
msgstr "You are now a Risk Report Comparison Analyst. Please determine whether the following two risk reports describe the **same risk issue**. \n\n## Judgment Criteria\n- If the **core risk points** of the two reports are the same** (for example, both are talking about high CPU load, both are talking about insufficient disk space), even if the wording is different, the values ​​are slightly different, and the time range is different, they are still regarded as **the same risk**. \n- If two reports describe **different types of risk issues** (for example, one says high CPU and the other says insufficient disk), they are considered **different risks**. \n- If a report contains new risk points (even if it also contains old risk points), it is considered a **different risk**. \n\n## Last risk report\n{last_report}\n\n## This risk report\n{current_report}\n\n## Output requirements\nOnly need to output a JSON, no other content:\n- Same risk: {{\"is_same_risk\": true, \"reason\": \"Short description of the reason\"}}\n- Different risk: {{\"is_same_risk\": false, \"reason\": \"Short description of the reason\"}}\n"

