"* 集群域名、集群ID、集群类型、DB类型\n"
"* 业务ID\n"
"* 主机机型(bk_svr_device_cls_name)、机器类型、规格ID(spec_id)\n"
"* 子Zone、城市\n"
"* 亲和性(disaster_tolerance_level)\n"
"* 关联实例端口列表\n"
"* 关联实例角色列表(instance_inner_roles)"
msgstr "Query the cluster information to which the host belongs based on a single IP. Only DBA can call it\nThe returned fields include:\n* Cluster domain name, cluster ID, cluster type, DB type\n* Business ID\n* Host model (bk_svr_device_cls_name), machine type, specification ID (spec_id)\n* Sub-zone, city\n* Affinity (disaster_tolerance_level)\n* Associated instance port list\n* Associated instance role list (instance_inner_roles)"

