#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:59
msgid "Kafka集群扩容单据(支持资源池和手工输入两种方式)"
msgstr "Kafka cluster expansion document (supports resource pool and manual input)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:87
msgid ""
"Kafka集群缩容单据。注意事项：1. nodes参数需要包含待缩容节点的(ip, "
"bk_host_id, bk_cloud_id)2. 当用户只提供IP地址时，必须先调用cluster_overview接"
"口获取完整的节点信息(bk_host_id, bk_cloud_id)"
msgstr "Kafka cluster reduction document. Notes: 1. The nodes parameter needs to contain the node to be reduced (ip, bk_host_id, bk_cloud_id) 2. When the user only provides the IP address, the cluster_overview interface must be called first to obtain the complete node information (bk_host_id, bk_cloud_id)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:116
msgid ""
"Kafka集群替换单据，支持资源池和手工输入。重要规则：1.用户指定规格名称时，须先"
"调用search_specs_by_name获取spec_id再传入resource_spec，不指定则使用原节点规"
"格；2.ip_source=manual_input时必须提供new_nodes；3.old_nodes须含bk_host_id和"
"bk_cloud_id，仅有IP时先调cluster_overview获取。"
msgstr "Kafka cluster replacement document supports resource pool and manual input. Important rules: 1. When the user specifies the specification name, he must first call search_specs_by_name to obtain the spec_id and then pass in the resource_spec. If not specified, the original node specification will be used; 2. New_nodes must be provided when ip_source=manual_input; 3. Old_nodes must contain bk_host_id and bk_cloud_id. If there is only IP, call cluster_overview first to obtain it."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:152
msgid ""
"Kafka集群Topic均衡单据，对指定topic进行分区重均衡以平衡broker负载。重要规则："
"1.指定目标broker时，须先调cluster_overview获取IP，再传入target_ips；2.用户当"
"前请求未提及速率时，必须省略throttle_rate，不要从历史对话获取速率值。"
msgstr "Kafka cluster Topic balancing document performs partition rebalancing on the specified topic to balance the broker load. Important rules: 1. When specifying the target broker, you must first adjust cluster_overview to obtain the IP, and then pass in target_ips; 2. When the user&#39;s current request does not mention the rate, you must omit throttle_rate and do not obtain the rate value from historical conversations."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:185
msgid ""
"Kafka实例重启单据。用途：重启指定的Kafka broker实例。参数说明：1. bk_biz_id："
"必填，业务ID2. cluster_domain：必填，集群域名3. instance_list：必填，需要重启"
"的实例列表。每个实例需要包含ip、port、bk_host_id、bk_cloud_id。注意事项：当用"
"户只提供IP地址时，必须先调用cluster_overview接口获取完整的实例信息"
"(bk_host_id, bk_cloud_id, port)"
msgstr "Kafka instance restart document. Purpose: Restart the specified Kafka broker instance. Parameter description: 1. bk_biz_id: required, business ID 2. cluster_domain: required, cluster domain name 3. instance_list: required, list of instances that need to be restarted. Each instance needs to contain ip, port, bk_host_id, bk_cloud_id. Note: When the user only provides the IP address, the cluster_overview interface must be called first to obtain the complete instance information (bk_host_id, bk_cloud_id, port)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:219
msgid ""
"Kafka集群启用单据。用途：将禁用的Kafka集群重新上线。参数说明：1. bk_biz_id："
"必填，业务ID2. cluster_domain：必填，集群域名前置条件：集群必须处于禁用状态才"
"能启用。如果集群是在线状态，无需操作。"
msgstr "Kafka cluster enables documents. Purpose: Bring the disabled Kafka cluster back online. Parameter description: 1. bk_biz_id: required, business ID 2. cluster_domain: required, cluster domain name Precondition: the cluster must be disabled before it can be enabled. If the cluster is online, no action is required."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:248
msgid ""
"Kafka集群禁用单据。用途：将Kafka集群下线禁用，数据保留，可恢复。参数说明：1. "
"bk_biz_id：必填，业务ID2. cluster_domain：必填，集群域名"
msgstr "Kafka cluster disables documents. Purpose: To disable the Kafka cluster offline, the data is retained and can be restored. Parameter description: 1. bk_biz_id: required, business ID2. cluster_domain: required, cluster domain name"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:271
msgid ""
"Kafka集群删除单据。用途：永久删除Kafka集群及其数据，不可恢复。参数说明：1. "
"bk_biz_id：必填，业务ID2. cluster_domain：必填，集群域名前置条件：集群必须处"
"于禁用状态才能删除。如果集群是在线状态，请先调用禁用接口。 important: 此操作"
"将永久删除集群数据，不可恢复，请谨慎操作！"
msgstr "Kafka cluster deletes documents. Purpose: Permanently delete the Kafka cluster and its data, which is irrecoverable. Parameter description: 1. bk_biz_id: required, business ID2. cluster_domain: required, cluster domain name precondition: the cluster must be disabled before it can be deleted. If the cluster is online, please call the disable interface first. important: This operation will permanently delete the cluster data and cannot be recovered, please operate with caution!"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_bill_mcp.py:302
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Kafka集群部署单据，支持资源池和手工输入，部署包含zookeeper和broker的新集群。"
"重要规则：1.zookeeper固定3个节点，broker至少1个，副本数不能超过broker数量；2."
"city_code：用户说'随机'或不指定时用'default'，否则用实际城市名称；3.域名格"
"式：kafka.{cluster_name}.{db_app_abbr}.db；4.仅有IP时须先调cluster_overview获"
"取bk_host_id和bk_cloud_id。"
msgstr "Kafka cluster deployment document supports resource pooling and manual input, and deploys a new cluster including zookeeper and broker. Important rules: 1. Zookeeper has 3 fixed nodes, at least 1 broker, and the number of replicas cannot exceed the number of brokers; 2. city_code: use &#39;default&#39; when the user says &#39;random&#39; or does not specify, otherwise use the actual city name; 3. Domain name format: kafka.{cluster_name}.{db_app_abbr}.db; 4. When there is only IP, cluster_overview must be adjusted first to obtain bk_host_id and bk_cloud_id."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_metrics_mcp.py:51
msgid ""
"查询Kafka集群监控指标，获取指定时间范围内的指标数据。支持流量/CPU/内存/磁盘/"
"网络/性能/延迟/日志等指标，不传metric_types则查询所有。返回每个指标的时间序列"
"数据点和统计信息(min,max,avg,latest,count)。"
msgstr "Query Kafka cluster monitoring indicators and obtain indicator data within a specified time range. Supports traffic/CPU/memory/disk/network/performance/latency/log and other indicators. If metric_types is not passed, all will be queried. Returns time series data points and statistics (min, max, avg, latest, count) for each indicator."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_metrics_mcp.py:84
msgid ""
"获取Kafka集群性能摘要。用途：快速获取集群最近N天的关键性能指标摘要，包括流"
"量、资源使用和健康状态。参数说明：1. bk_biz_id：必填，业务ID2. "
"cluster_domain：必填，集群域名3. days：可选，查询最近N天的数据，默认7天，范围"
"1-30天返回数据：- traffic_summary: 流量摘要（生产/消费峰值和平均流量）- "
"resource_summary: 资源摘要（CPU/内存/磁盘的平均和峰值使用率）- "
"health_summary: 健康状态摘要（副本不足分区数、离线分区数）典型使用场景：- 用"
"户询问'这个集群最近表现怎么样'时，调用此接口获取摘要- 用户询问'CPU使用率高"
"吗'、'流量有多大'等问题时，先调用此接口获取概览"
msgstr "Get a Kafka cluster performance summary. Purpose: Quickly obtain a summary of key performance indicators of the cluster in the last N days, including traffic, resource usage, and health status. Parameter description: 1. bk_biz_id: required, business ID 2. cluster_domain: required, cluster domain name 3. days: optional, query the data of the last N days, default 7 days, range 1-30 days Return data: - traffic_summary: Traffic summary (production/consumption peak and average traffic) - resource_summary: Resource summary (average and peak usage of CPU/memory/disk) - health_summary: Typical usage scenarios of health status summary (number of partitions with insufficient replicas, number of offline partitions): - When the user asks &#39;How is the recent performance of this cluster&#39;, call this interface to obtain the summary - When the user asks &#39;Is the CPU usage high&#39;, &#39;How much is the traffic&#39;, etc., call this interface first to obtain the overview"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_metrics_mcp.py:123
msgid ""
"查询Kafka维度明细指标TopN排行。支持按topic/broker/consumer_group/disk维度查"
"询。topic维度: topic_traffic_in(生产流量), topic_traffic_out(消费流量), "
"topic_message_rate(消息速率), topic_log_size(数据量); 消费组: "
"consumer_group_lag(积压量); broker维度: broker_traffic_in/out, "
"broker_produce/fetch_request_rate, broker_cpu_usage, broker_tcp_established; "
"磁盘: disk_usage_detail(按挂载点)。返回各维度条目的latest_value和统计信息，按"
"值降序排列。"
msgstr "Query the TopN ranking of Kafka dimension detailed indicators. Supports querying by topic/broker/consumer_group/disk dimension. topic dimensions: topic_traffic_in (production traffic), topic_traffic_out (consumption traffic), topic_message_rate (message rate), topic_log_size (data volume); consumer group: consumer_group_lag (backlog); broker dimension: broker_traffic_in/out, broker_produce/fetch_request_rate, broker_cpu_usage, broker_tcp_established; disk: disk_usage_detail (by mount point). Returns the latest_value and statistical information of each dimension entry, sorted by value in descending order."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:73
msgid ""
"列出Kafka集群所有topic。返回集群中所有topic的名称列表和数量。参数："
"cluster_domain（集群域名）"
msgstr "List all topics in the Kafka cluster. Returns the name list and number of all topics in the cluster. Parameter: cluster_domain (cluster domain name)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:86
msgid ""
"查看Kafka topic详细信息，包括分区数、副本因子、ISR列表、配置等。参数："
"cluster_domain（集群域名），topic（topic名称）"
msgstr "View Kafka topic details, including number of partitions, replication factor, ISR list, configuration, etc. Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), topic (topic name)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:102
msgid ""
"列出Kafka集群所有消费组。返回集群中所有消费组的名称列表和数量。参数："
"cluster_domain（集群域名）"
msgstr "List all consumer groups in the Kafka cluster. Returns a list of names and quantities of all consumer groups in the cluster. Parameter: cluster_domain (cluster domain name)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:115
msgid ""
"查看Kafka消费组详细信息，包括各分区的offset、lag、消费者分配情况。参数："
"cluster_domain（集群域名），group（消费组名称）"
msgstr "View the detailed information of the Kafka consumer group, including the offset, lag, and consumer allocation of each partition. Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), group (consumer group name)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:131
msgid ""
"查看Kafka topic配置覆盖项，返回通过kafka-configs设置的非默认配置。参数："
"cluster_domain（集群域名），topic（topic名称）"
msgstr "View the Kafka topic configuration overrides and return the non-default configuration set through kafka-configs. Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), topic (topic name)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:148
msgid ""
"查看Kafka broker配置覆盖项，返回通过kafka-configs设置的非默认配置。参数："
"cluster_domain（集群域名），broker_id（broker ID）"
msgstr "View the Kafka broker configuration overrides and return the non-default configuration set through kafka-configs. Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), broker_id (broker ID)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:167
msgid ""
"修改Kafka topic配置项（如retention.ms、cleanup.policy、max.message.bytes"
"等）。参数：cluster_domain（集群域名），topic（topic名称），config_key（配置"
"项名称），config_value（配置值）"
msgstr "Modify Kafka topic configuration items (such as retention.ms, cleanup.policy, max.message.bytes, etc.). Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), topic (topic name), config_key (configuration item name), config_value (configuration value)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:189
msgid ""
"修改Kafka topic分区数（只能增加不能减少，不可逆操作）。参数：cluster_domain"
"（集群域名），topic（topic名称），partitions（目标分区数，必须大于当前分区"
"数）"
msgstr "Modify the number of Kafka topic partitions (can only be increased but not decreased, irreversible operation). Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), topic (topic name), partitions (number of target partitions, must be greater than the current number of partitions)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:209
msgid ""
"重置Kafka topic配置项为默认值（删除通过kafka-configs设置的覆盖配置）。参数："
"cluster_domain（集群域名），topic（topic名称），config_key（要重置的配置项名"
"称）"
msgstr "Reset the Kafka topic configuration items to default values ​​(delete the overriding configuration set through kafka-configs). Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), topic (topic name), config_key (name of configuration item to be reset)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:231
msgid ""
"重置Kafka消费组offset。支持4种策略：to-earliest（重置到最早），to-latest（重"
"置到最新），to-offset（重置到指定offset，需提供strategy_value为数值），to-"
"datetime（重置到指定时间点，需提供strategy_value为'YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.000'格"
"式）。注意：消费组必须处于非活跃状态（所有消费者已停止）才能重置。"
msgstr "Reset the Kafka consumer group offset. Supports 4 strategies: to-earliest (reset to the earliest), to-latest (reset to the latest), to-offset (reset to the specified offset, the strategy_value must be provided as a numerical value), to-datetime (reset to the specified time point, the strategy_value must be provided in the format of &#39;YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.000&#39;). NOTE: The consumer group must be inactive (all consumers stopped) in order to be reset."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:256
msgid ""
"Kafka集群健康检查。返回在线broker列表、副本不足分区、不可用分区，以及整体健康"
"状态。参数：cluster_domain（集群域名）"
msgstr "Kafka cluster health check. Returns the list of online brokers, partitions with insufficient replicas, unavailable partitions, and overall health status. Parameter: cluster_domain (cluster domain name)"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/kafka/views/kafka_toolbox_mcp.py:271
msgid ""
"采样Kafka topic消息，用于确认topic中是否有数据以及数据格式。默认从头消费最多"
"10条消息，超时10秒。参数：cluster_domain（集群域名），topic（topic名称），"
"max_messages（最多采样条数，默认10，上限20），from_beginning（是否从头消费，"
"默认true），timeout_ms（超时毫秒数，默认10000）"
msgstr "Sampling Kafka topic messages to confirm whether there is data in the topic and the data format. By default, a maximum of 10 messages can be consumed from scratch, with a timeout of 10 seconds. Parameters: cluster_domain (cluster domain name), topic (topic name), max_messages (maximum number of samples, default 10, upper limit 20), from_beginning (whether to consume from the beginning, default true), timeout_ms (timeout milliseconds, default 10000)"

