"参数说明：\n"
"- bk_biz_id: 业务ID（必填）\n"
"- cluster_domain: 集群域名（必填）\n"
"- target_cluster_domain: 目标集群域名（必填）\n"
"- databases: 数据库列表（缺省 [\"*\"]，需用户确认）\n"
"- tables: 表列表（缺省 [\"*\"]，需用户确认）\n"
"- rollback_time: 构造时间点 ISO 8601（与 backup_id 二选一）\n"
"- backup_id: 备份ID（可选, 与 rollback_time 二选一）\n"
msgstr "Create TenDBHA, TenDBCluster data structure to existing cluster documents\nParameter description:\n- bk_biz_id: business ID (required)\n- cluster_domain: cluster domain name (required)\n- target_cluster_domain: target cluster domain name (required)\n- databases: database list (default [\"*\"], user confirmation is required)\n- tables: Table list (default [\"*\"], user confirmation is required)\n- rollback_time: construction time point ISO 8601 (choose one from backup_id)\n- backup_id: backup ID (optional, choose one from rollback_time)\n"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/mysql/views/mysql_config_update.py:33
msgid ""
"修改 MySQL 集群周边工具的配置\n"
"支持修改的配置类型（conf_type):\n"
"- backup: 备份配置，conf_file 可选值为 binlog_rotate.yaml / dbbackup.ini / "
"dbbackup.options\n"
"  - 修改备份开始时间: conf_file=dbbackup.options, conf_name=CrontabTime, "
"conf_value=\"3 5 * * *\"\n"
"  - 修改备份类型: conf_file=dbbackup.ini, conf_name=Public.BackupType, "
"conf_value=logical (physical)\n"
"- mysql_monitor: 监控配置，conf_file 固定为 items-config.yaml\n"
"- checksum: 校验配置，conf_file 固定为 checksum.yaml\n"
"  - 关闭数据校验: conf_file=checksum.yaml, conf_name=enable, "
"conf_value=false\n"
"仅支持修改集群级别（cluster）的配置\n"
msgstr "Modify the configuration of MySQL cluster peripheral tools\nSupported modified configuration types (conf_type):\n- backup: backup configuration, conf_file optional values are binlog_rotate.yaml / dbbackup.ini / dbbackup.options\n - Modify the backup start time: conf_file=dbbackup.options, conf_name=CrontabTime, conf_value=\"3 5 * * *\"\n - Modify the backup type: conf_file=dbbackup.ini, conf_name=Public.BackupType, conf_value=logical (physical)\n- mysql_monitor: Monitoring configuration, conf_file is fixed to items-config.yaml\n- checksum: Verification configuration, conf_file is fixed to checkssum.yaml\n - Turn off data verification: conf_file=checksum.yaml, conf_name=enable, conf_value=false\nOnly supports modifying cluster-level configuration\n"

