"10GB 的表，按 data_free 降序排列。TenDBCluster 会分别查询各 remote slave 分片"
"后按逻辑库表汇聚。cluster_id 与 cluster_domain 二选一。"
msgstr "Query MySQL table hole fragments (information_schema.tables.data_free). Only tables with holes larger than 10GB are returned, sorted by data_free in descending order. TenDBCluster will query each remote slave shard separately and then aggregate them according to the logical library table. Choose one of cluster_id and cluster_domain."

