#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/mysql/views/mysql_slowlog_mcp.py:39
msgid ""
"获取 tendbsingle, tendbha, tendbcluster 集群的慢查询统计信息。返回的 "
"slow_logs 结果里面字段解读如下：\n"
"query_digest_md5: 是慢日志摘要字段的 MD5 值，也叫 digest 或者 query_digest;\n"
"metric_aggregate_type: 是慢查询的聚合统计方法，比如按查执行耗时排序(max by "
"query_time), 按执行次数取总和排序(count by query_digest_md5)，按扫描行数总和"
"排序(sum by rows_examined)\n"
"values: 聚合的结果，具体含义根据 metric_aggregate_type 来定\n"
"sample: 对应的一个慢 sql 样例，里面有详细信息，比如 sql指纹，sql 原文，扫描行"
"数等"
msgstr "Get the slow query statistics of tendbsingle, tendbha, and tendbcluster clusters. The fields in the returned slow_logs results are interpreted as follows:\nquery_digest_md5: It is the MD5 value of the slow log summary field, also called digest or query_digest;\nmetric_aggregate_type: It is the aggregation statistics method of slow query, such as sorting by query execution time (max by query_time), sorting by the sum of execution times (count by query_digest_md5), sorting by the sum of the number of scanned rows (sum by rows_examined)\nvalues: The result of aggregation, the specific meaning is determined according to metric_aggregate_type\nsample: A corresponding slow sql sample, which contains detailed information, such as sql fingerprint, sql original text, number of scanned rows, etc."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/mysql/views/mysql_slowlog_mcp.py:75
msgid "获取 tendbsingle, tendbha, tendbcluster 集群的慢查询统计信息"
msgstr "Get slow query statistics of tendbsingle, tendbha, tendbcluster clusters"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/mysql/views/mysql_table_capacity_mcp.py:39
msgid ""
"查询 tendbsingle, tendbha, tendbcluster 集群中指定数据库的大小。"
"database_names 传 ['*'] 则查询所有数据库大小。tendbcluster 集群会自动将各分片"
"数据汇总，返回的是逻辑库的总大小。返回的 database_size 单位是字节(bytes)。"
"limit 按库名字典序截取（默认 20）；top_n 按库大小降序截取，与 limit 互斥；"
"min_size_bytes 可过滤掉小于该字节数的库。"
msgstr "Query the size of the specified database in the tendbsingle, tendbha, tendbcluster cluster. If database_names is passed [&#39;*&#39;], all database sizes will be queried. The tendbcluster cluster will automatically summarize the data of each shard and return the total size of the logical library. The returned database_size unit is bytes. limit intercepts in dictionary order of library names (default 20); top_n intercepts in descending order of library size, mutually exclusive with limit; min_size_bytes can filter out libraries smaller than this number of bytes."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/mysql/views/mysql_table_capacity_mcp.py:79
msgid ""
"查询 tendbsingle, tendbha, tendbcluster 集群中表的大小。database_name 可选，"
"传则查询指定库下的表，不传则跨集群下所有库查询符合 table_names 的表。"
"table_names 传 ['*'] 则查询所有表大小。tendbcluster 集群会自动将各分片数据汇"
"总，返回的是逻辑表的总大小。返回的 table_size 单位是字节(bytes)。limit 按表名"
"字典序截取（默认 50)；top_n 按表大小降序截取，与 limit 互斥；min_size_bytes "
"可过滤掉小于该字节数的表。"
msgstr "Query the size of tables in tendbsingle, tendbha, tendbcluster clusters. database_name is optional. If passed, the table under the specified library will be queried. If not passed, the table matching table_names will be queried across all libraries in the cluster. If table_names is passed [&#39;*&#39;], all table sizes will be queried. The tendbcluster cluster will automatically summarize the data of each shard and return the total size of the logical table. The returned table_size unit is bytes. limit intercepts table names in dictionary order (default 50); top_n intercepts tables in descending order of size, mutually exclusive with limit; min_size_bytes can filter out tables smaller than this number of bytes."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/mysql/views/sql_syntax_check_mcp.py:39
msgid ""
"Check SQL syntax for TenDBHA/TenDBCluster against MySQL 5.5/5.6/5.7/8.0. "
"Validates syntax errors and DBM constraints (banned commands, high-risk "
"ops). Use cases: pre-execution validation, cross-version compatibility, "
"detect TRUNCATE/DROP DATABASE."
msgstr "Check SQL syntax for TenDBHA/TenDBCluster against MySQL 5.5/5.6/5.7/8.0. Validates syntax errors and DBM constraints (banned commands, high-risk ops). Use cases: pre-execution validation, cross-version compatibility, detect TRUNCATE/DROP DATABASE."

