"Check SQL file syntax for TenDBHA/TenDBCluster against MySQL "
"5.5/5.6/5.7/8.0. PREREQUISITE: SQL files must be uploaded to BKRepo before "
"calling this tool. This tool reads files from BKRepo only; it does NOT "
"upload files. Validates syntax errors and DBM constraints (banned commands, "
"high-risk ops). path=BKRepo dir (format: /{project}/{repo}/{dir}/), "
"file_list=filenames only."
msgstr "Check SQL file syntax for TenDBHA/TenDBCluster against MySQL 5.5/5.6/5.7/8.0. PREREQUISITE: SQL files must be uploaded to BKRepo before calling this tool. This tool reads files from BKRepo only; it does NOT upload files. Validates syntax errors and DBM constraints (banned commands, high-risk ops). path=BKRepo dir (format: /{project}/{repo}/{dir}/), file_list=filenames only."

