#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/serializers/instance_status.py:281
msgid ""
"要查询的信息模块列表，可选值：\n"
"- server: 服务器基本信息（版本、运行时长等）\n"
"- clients: 客户端连接概要（连接数、阻塞数等）\n"
"- memory: 内存使用详情（used_memory、碎片率等）\n"
"- persistence: 持久化状态（RDB/AOF）\n"
"- stats: 运行统计（OPS、命中率、过期键等）\n"
"- replication: 主从复制状态（角色、偏移量、从节点列表）\n"
"- cpu: CPU使用情况\n"
"- keyspace: 键空间信息（各DB的键数量、TTL）\n"
"- client_list: 当前所有已连接客户端详细列表\n"
"- command_stats: 命令调用统计（1秒采样，每秒调用次数和耗时）\n"
"不传则返回所有模块。"
msgstr "List of information modules to be queried, optional values:\n- server: basic server information (version, running time, etc.)\n- clients: client connection summary (number of connections, number of blocks, etc.)\n- memory: memory usage details (used_memory, fragmentation rate, etc.)\n- persistence: persistence status (RDB/AOF)\n- stats: running statistics (OPS, hit rate, expired keys, etc.)\n- replication: Master-slave replication status (role, offset, slave node list)\n- cpu: CPU usage\n- keyspace: key space information (number of keys in each DB, TTL)\n- client_list: detailed list of all currently connected clients\n- command_stats: command call statistics (1 second sampling, number of calls per second and time consumption)\nIf not passed, all modules will be returned."

