"group_by: ip, instance, bucket, cluster_domain. Keep max_len_datapoints<=15 "
"to avoid context length issues; mermaid_code output AS-IS."
msgstr "Query time-series metrics for Redis cluster PROXY nodes. Applicable metrics: cpu_usage, memory_usage, io_usage, disk_usage, connections, qps, host_latency, command_latency, latency_distribution (not capacity). group_by: ip, instance, bucket, cluster_domain. Keep max_len_datapoints<=15 to avoid context length issues; mermaid_code output AS-IS."

