#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/metrics.py:301
msgid ""
"Query time-series metrics for a specific machine (by IP). Cluster and "
"instance role are auto-resolved. All metric types are accepted; "
"latency_distribution is proxy-only, capacity is backend-only. group_by: ip, "
"instance, bucket (not cluster_domain). Keep max_len_datapoints<=15 to avoid "
"context length issues; mermaid_code output AS-IS."
msgstr "Query time-series metrics for a specific machine (by IP). Cluster and instance role are auto-resolved. All metric types are accepted; latency_distribution is proxy-only, capacity is backend-only. group_by: ip, instance, bucket (not cluster_domain). Keep max_len_datapoints<=15 to avoid context length issues; mermaid_code output AS-IS."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/metrics.py:331
msgid ""
"Query scalar statistics (min/max/avg/p95/cv/trend) for a specific machine "
"(by IP). Cluster and instance role are auto-resolved. All metric types are "
"accepted; latency_distribution is proxy-only, capacity is backend-only. "
"group_by: ip, instance, bucket (not cluster_domain)."
msgstr "Query scalar statistics (min/max/avg/p95/cv/trend) for a specific machine (by IP). Cluster and instance role are auto-resolved. All metric types are accepted; latency_distribution is proxy-only, capacity is backend-only. group_by: ip, instance, bucket (not cluster_domain)."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/metrics.py:365
msgid ""
"Query time-series metrics for a specific instance (by IP + port). Cluster "
"and instance role are auto-resolved. Metrics: connections, qps, "
"host_latency, command_latency, latency_distribution (proxy), capacity "
"(backend); not host resource metrics (cpu/memory/io/disk). group_by: "
"instance, bucket (not cluster_domain or ip). Keep max_len_datapoints<=15 to "
"avoid context length issues; mermaid_code output AS-IS."
msgstr "Query time-series metrics for a specific instance (by IP + port). Cluster and instance role are auto-resolved. Metrics: connections, qps, host_latency, command_latency, latency_distribution (proxy), capacity (backend); not host resource metrics (cpu/memory/io/disk). group_by: instance, bucket (not cluster_domain or ip). Keep max_len_datapoints<=15 to avoid context length issues; mermaid_code output AS-IS."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/metrics.py:396
msgid ""
"Query scalar statistics (min/max/avg/p95/cv/trend) for a specific instance "
"(by IP + port). Cluster and instance role are auto-resolved. Metrics: "
"connections, qps, host_latency, command_latency, latency_distribution "
"(proxy), capacity (backend); not host resource metrics (cpu/memory/io/disk). "
"group_by: instance, bucket (not cluster_domain or ip)."
msgstr "Query scalar statistics (min/max/avg/p95/cv/trend) for a specific instance (by IP + port). Cluster and instance role are auto-resolved. Metrics: connections, qps, host_latency, command_latency, latency_distribution (proxy), capacity (backend); not host resource metrics (cpu/memory/io/disk). group_by: instance, bucket (not cluster_domain or ip)."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_alarm.py:36
msgid "查询获取集群时间范围内告警列表"
msgstr "Query to obtain the alarm list within the cluster time range"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_alarm.py:54
msgid "查询某个业务在时间范围内告警信息,按集群汇总"
msgstr "Query the alarm information of a certain business within a time range, summarized by cluster"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_log.py:55
msgid ""
"查询慢查询日志(slowlog)，包括执行时间、命令内容等。可用于分析Redis性能问题和"
"慢查询优化。如果不传 ip，则获取集群时间范围内慢查询日志统计数据（返回结构见 "
"RedisSlowClusterStaticSerializer）；如果传入 ip（和可选的 port），则查询该机"
"器或实例的详细慢查询日志列表（返回结构见 RedisSlowlogResponseSerializer）。"
msgstr "Query the slow query log (slowlog), including execution time, command content, etc. Can be used to analyze Redis performance issues and optimize slow queries. If the IP is not passed, the slow query log statistics within the cluster time range are obtained (for the return structure, see RedisSlowClusterStaticSerializer); if the IP (and optional port) is passed, the detailed slow query log list of the machine or instance is queried (for the return structure, see RedisSlowlogResponseSerializer)."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_log.py:95
msgid ""
"查询大key日志。注意：大key是每天早上8点开始统计的，非实时数据，且仅在slave节"
"点上进行统计，统计时取了TopN的数据。如果不传 ip，则获取集群时间范围内大key日"
"志统计数据（包含全局摘要和按实例维度的Top10大key，返回结构见 "
"RedisBigkeyClusterStaticSerializer）；如果传入 ip（和可选的 port），则查询该"
"机器或实例的详细大key日志列表（按Value大小降序排列，返回结构见 "
"RedisBigkeyResponseSerializer）。"
msgstr "Query the big key log. Note: Big keys are counted starting at 8 a.m. every morning. They are non-real-time data and are only counted on the slave node. The TopN data is taken for statistics. If the IP is not passed, the big key log statistics within the cluster time range are obtained (including the global summary and the Top 10 big keys by instance dimension. For the return structure, see RedisBigkeyClusterStaticSerializer). If the IP (and optional port) is passed, the detailed big key log list of the machine or instance is queried (arranged in descending order by Value size. For the return structure, see RedisBigkeyResponseSerializer)."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_log.py:132
msgid ""
"查询 server log 日志。如果不传 ip，则获取集群时间范围内 server log 统计数据"
"（返回结构见 RedisServerlogClusterStaticSerializer）；如果传入 ip（和可选的 "
"port），则查询该机器或实例的详细 server log 日志列表（返回结构见 "
"RedisServerlogResponseSerializer）。可用于分析 Redis/Twemproxy 服务端运行日"
"志。"
msgstr "Query the server log. If the IP is not passed, the server log statistics within the cluster time range are obtained (for the return structure, see RedisServerlogClusterStaticSerializer); if the IP (and optional port) is passed, the detailed server log list of the machine or instance is queried (for the return structure, see RedisServerlogResponseSerializer). Can be used to analyze Redis/Twemproxy server operation logs."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:68
msgid ""
"查询当前用户负责管理的所有 Redis 业务列表，当用户未提供 bk_biz_id 时，应先调"
"用此接口获取可用业务列表。"
msgstr "Query the list of all Redis services managed by the current user. When the user does not provide bk_biz_id, this interface should be called first to obtain the list of available services."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:81
msgid ""
"通过业务英文名（模糊匹配）查询业务信息，当用户提供了业务名称但未提供 "
"bk_biz_id 时，应先调用此接口将名称转换为 bk_biz_id"
msgstr "Query business information through the business English name (fuzzy matching). When the user provides the business name but not bk_biz_id, this interface should be called first to convert the name to bk_biz_id"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:95
msgid "查询指定业务（bk_biz_id）下的所有 Redis 集群列表，支持分页"
msgstr "Query the list of all Redis clusters under the specified business (bk_biz_id), supporting paging"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:112
msgid "查询指定 Redis 集群的基本概览信息，需要提供集群域名（cluster_domain）。"
msgstr "To query the basic overview information of a specified Redis cluster, you need to provide the cluster domain name (cluster_domain)."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:126
msgid ""
"查询指定 Redis 集群的 Proxy（代理层）实例统计摘要。适合快速了解集群代理层整体"
"健康状况，不返回具体实例列表。"
msgstr "Query the statistical summary of the Proxy (proxy layer) instance of the specified Redis cluster. It is suitable for quickly understanding the overall health status of the cluster agent layer without returning a specific instance list."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:140
msgid ""
"查询指定 Redis 集群的存储层（redis_master 和 redis_slave）实例统计摘要，适合"
"快速了解集群存储层整体规模和健康状况，不返回具体实例列表。"
msgstr "Query the instance statistics summary of the storage layer (redis_master and redis_slave) of the specified Redis cluster. It is suitable for quickly understanding the overall scale and health status of the cluster storage layer without returning a specific instance list."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:154
msgid ""
"查询指定 Redis 集群的 Proxy 节点详细列表，支持通过 ips 参数过滤特定主机，支持"
"分页参数"
msgstr "Query the detailed list of Proxy nodes of the specified Redis cluster. It supports filtering specific hosts through the ips parameter and supports paging parameters."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:171
msgid ""
"查询指定 Redis 集群的存储节点主从关系对列表，支持通过 addrs 参数过滤与特定实"
"例相关的主从对，支持分页。适合排查主从关系、定位某个实例的对端节点。"
msgstr "Query the list of master-slave relationship pairs of storage nodes in the specified Redis cluster. It supports filtering the master-slave pairs related to specific instances through the addrs parameter, and supports paging. It is suitable for checking the master-slave relationship and locating the peer node of a certain instance."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:192
msgid "根据输入的主机 IP 列表，反查这些主机所属的 Redis 集群信息。"
msgstr "Based on the entered host IP list, check the Redis cluster information to which these hosts belong."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_meta.py:206
msgid ""
"查询指定集群内特定实例的详细信息，适合深入排查某个具体实例的配置和状态。"
msgstr "Query the detailed information of a specific instance in a specified cluster, which is suitable for in-depth investigation of the configuration and status of a specific instance."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_status.py:44
msgid ""
"查询指定 Redis 集群的整体负载标签（如高负载/低负载），用于快速判断集群当前压"
"力水平。"
msgstr "Query the overall load label (such as high load/low load) of the specified Redis cluster to quickly determine the current pressure level of the cluster."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/redis/views/query_status.py:60
msgid ""
"查询指定 Redis 实例的详细状态信息，支持通过 sections 参数按需选择模块，避免一"
"次性返回过多数据。此为实例级别接口，需提供具体的实例地址（redis_addr）。"
msgstr "Query the detailed status information of the specified Redis instance, and support selecting modules on demand through the sections parameter to avoid returning too much data at one time. This is an instance-level interface, and a specific instance address (redis_addr) needs to be provided."

