"可选表名精确过滤，仅允许 [A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_$#@]{0,127}；传入后等价于『查这"
"一张表的状态』，limit 自动收敛为 1，表不存在时返回空列表，不抛异常"
msgstr "Optional table name precise filtering, only [A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_$#@]{0,127} is allowed; after passing it in, it is equivalent to 'check the status of this table'. The limit automatically converges to 1. When the table does not exist, an empty list is returned and no exception is thrown."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/serializers/list_table_status.py:60
msgid "返回前 N 条（按总大小倒序）；缺省 200，最大 1000"
msgstr "Return the first N items (in descending order of total size); default 200, maximum 1000"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/serializers/list_table_status.py:67
msgid ""
"输出粒度（三态枚举，互斥）。summary（默认）：仅 schema_name/table_name/"
"row_count/total_size_mb 4 个字段，token 友好，适合浏览全库表清单；detail：返"
"回 20 个全字段，索引分析等深度场景使用；count_only：跳过明细查询，仅返回 "
"total_user_table_count（叠加 schema/table_name 过滤后），tables 为空数组、"
"limit 置 0；用于回答『这个库一共有多少张用户表』；此模式下 order_by / order "
"静默忽略"
msgstr "Output granularity (three-state enumeration, mutual exclusion). summary (default): only schema_name/table_name/row_count/total_size_mb 4 fields, token-friendly, suitable for browsing the full database table list; detail: returns 20 full fields, used in in-depth scenarios such as index analysis; count_only: skips detailed query, only returns total_user_table_count (after superimposing schema/table_name filtering), tables is an empty array, limit Set to 0; used to answer 'How many user tables does this library have?'; order_by / order is silently ignored in this mode"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/serializers/list_table_status.py:83
msgid ""
"排序键，缺省 total_size_mb。total_size_mb（找大表，最常见入口）；row_count"
"（按行数排序）；index_size_mb（找索引膨胀的表）；stats_outdated_count（找统计"
"过期最严重的表，UPDATE STATISTICS 候选）；last_user_update（按写入活跃度排"
"序，desc=最近被写、asc=最久未被写）。注意：summary 模式只返回 4 个 L1 字段，"
"若按非 L1 字段排序，明细里看不到该字段值，如需查看请用 verbose=detail；"
"verbose=count_only 时此参数被忽略"
msgstr "Sort key, default total_size_mb. total_size_mb (find the large table, the most common entry); row_count (sort by row number); index_size_mb (find the table with index expansion); stats_outdated_count (find the table with the most expired statistics, UPDATE STATISTICS candidate); last_user_update (sort by write activity, desc=most recently written, asc=longest unwritten). Note: summary mode only returns 4 L1 fields. If you sort by non-L1 fields, the field value cannot be seen in the details. If you need to view it, please use verbose=detail; this parameter is ignored when verbose=count_only"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/serializers/list_table_status.py:99
msgid ""
"排序方向，desc（默认）或 asc；非法值容错回落到 desc；verbose=count_only 时此"
"参数被忽略"
msgstr "Sorting direction, desc (default) or asc; error tolerance for illegal values ​​falls back to desc; this parameter is ignored when verbose=count_only"

