#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:108
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 实例基础信息（版本、Edition、CPU、内存、启动时间等）；address "
"不传时返回集群内所有实例的信息"
msgstr "Query the basic information of the SQL Server instance (version, edition, CPU, memory, startup time, etc.); if the address is not passed, the information of all instances in the cluster will be returned."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:123
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 实例上的数据库清单（含状态、恢复模式、兼容级别、大小）；"
"address 不传时返回集群内所有实例的清单"
msgstr "Query the database list on the SQL Server instance (including status, recovery model, compatibility level, size); if address is not passed, a list of all instances in the cluster is returned."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:149
msgid ""
"列出 SQLServer 业务库下用户表的状态信息（行数、占用大小、最近活跃、统计过期"
"度）；用于在精细分析（get_table_schema / get_table_indexes 等）之前先定位值得"
"分析的表；默认按总占用大小倒序返回前 200 条；address 不传时缺省走 master；"
"verbose 三态枚举（互斥）：summary（默认）只返回 4 个核心字段（schema_name/"
"table_name/row_count/total_size_mb），token 友好；detail 返回全部 20 个字段；"
"count_only 仅统计当前库（叠加过滤后）的用户表总数，不返回明细；支持 order_by"
"（total_size_mb/row_count/index_size_mb/stats_outdated_count/"
"last_user_update）+ order（desc/asc）自定义排序，verbose=count_only 时排序参"
"数被忽略；兼容 SQL Server 2008 ~ 2022"
msgstr "Lists the status information of user tables under the SQLServer business library (number of rows, occupied size, recent activity, statistical expiration); used to locate tables worthy of analysis before detailed analysis (get_table_schema / get_table_indexes, etc.); by default, the top 200 items are returned in descending order of total occupied size; when address is not passed, the master is used by default; verbose three-state enumeration (mutually exclusive): summary (default) only returns 4 core fields (schema_name/table_name/row_count/total_size_mb), token-friendly; detail returns all 20 fields; count_only only counts the total number of user tables in the current library (after superimposed filtering), and does not return details; supports order_by (total_size_mb/row_count/index_size_mb/stats_outdated_count/last_user_update) + order (desc/asc) custom sorting, the sorting parameters are ignored when verbose=count_only; compatible with SQL Server 2008 ~ 2022"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:193
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 实例关键配置摘要（白名单内的 sp_configure 选项）；address 不传"
"时返回集群内所有实例的配置"
msgstr "Query the key configuration summary of the SQL Server instance (sp_configure option in the whitelist); if the address is not passed, the configuration of all instances in the cluster is returned."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:208
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 当前阻塞会话快照（被阻塞请求 + 阻塞源信息）；address 不传时缺"
"省查询 master"
msgstr "Query the current blocked session snapshot of SQL Server (blocked request + blocking source information); if the address is not passed, the master will be queried by default"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:230
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 累计等待统计 TOP N（dm_os_wait_stats，已剔除良性等待）；"
"address 不传时缺省查询 master"
msgstr "Query the cumulative wait statistics TOP N of SQL Server (dm_os_wait_stats, benign waits have been eliminated); when the address is not passed, the default query master"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:252
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 当前活跃请求 TOP N（按 cpu/duration/reads/writes 排序）；"
"address 不传时缺省查询 master"
msgstr "Query the TOP N currently active requests of SQL Server (sorted by cpu/duration/reads/writes); if the address is not passed, the master will be queried by default."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:278
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 估算执行计划（SHOWPLAN_XML，仅编译不执行）；仅允许 SELECT / "
"WITH(CTE) 语句的计划分析，不允许多语句、写操作、DDL、xp_/sp_ 调用、WAITFOR、"
"USE/GO 等；address 不传时缺省走 master"
msgstr "Query SQLServer to estimate the execution plan (SHOWPLAN_XML, only compile but not execute); only plan analysis of SELECT / WITH(CTE) statements is allowed, multiple statements, write operations, DDL, xp_/sp_ calls, WAITFOR, USE/GO, etc. are not allowed; when address is not passed, master is used by default"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:308
msgid ""
"查询 SQLServer 慢日志（来源 [Monitor].[dbo].[TRACE_TSQL]）；支持按时间范围、"
"库名、最小耗时过滤，address 不传时缺省查询 master"
msgstr "Query the SQLServer slow log (source [Monitor].[dbo].[TRACE_TSQL]); supports filtering by time range, library name, and minimum time consumption. If the address is not passed, the master will be queried by default."

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:349
msgid ""
"批量查询 SQLServer 表结构（列、类型、可空、计算列、默认/检查约束、主键、外"
"键）；tables 一次传 1~20 张表，整批共用同一个 schema；每张表独立返回 status，"
"单表不存在不会让整批失败；address 不传时缺省走 master"
msgstr "Batch query SQL Server table structure (column, type, nullable, calculated column, default/check constraints, primary key, foreign key); tables are passed 1 to 20 tables at a time, and the whole batch shares the same schema; each table returns status independently, and the absence of a single table will not cause the whole batch to fail; when address is not passed, master is used by default"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:381
msgid ""
"批量查询 SQLServer 表上现有索引清单（含键列、INCLUDE 列、唯一性、是否禁用、近"
"似行数、压缩状态）；tables 一次传 1~20 张表，整批共用同一个 schema；每张表独"
"立返回 status；address 不传时缺省走 master"
msgstr "Batch query the list of existing indexes on the SQL Server table (including key columns, INCLUDE columns, uniqueness, disabled or not, approximate number of rows, compression status); tables are passed 1 to 20 tables at a time, and the entire batch shares the same schema; each table returns status independently; when address is not passed, master is used by default"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:413
msgid ""
"批量查询 SQLServer 表的统计对象状态（最近更新时间、采样行数、修改行数、是否过"
"期）；用于诊断执行计划行数估算偏差是否由统计过期引起；tables 一次传 1~20 张"
"表，整批共用同一个 schema；每张表独立返回 status；address 不传时缺省走 master"
msgstr "Query the status of statistical objects of SQL Server tables in batches (latest update time, number of sampled rows, number of modified rows, and whether it is expired); used to diagnose whether the estimation deviation of the execution plan row number is caused by statistical expiration; tables transfers 1 to 20 tables at a time, and the entire batch shares the same schema; each table returns status independently; when address is not passed, master is used by default"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:446
msgid ""
"批量查询 SQLServer 表上每个索引的使用画像（user_seek/scan/lookup/update 累计"
"计数）；用于识别冗余索引或从未使用的索引。计数为实例启动以来累计，故同时返回 "
"sqlserver_start_time 作为样本起点；tables 一次传 1~20 张表，整批共用同一个 "
"schema；每张表独立返回 status；address 不传时缺省走 master"
msgstr "Batch query usage portrait of each index on the SQL Server table (user_seek/scan/lookup/update cumulative count); used to identify redundant indexes or indexes that have never been used. The count is accumulated since the instance was started, so sqlserver_start_time is also returned as the starting point of the sample; tables transfers 1 to 20 tables at a time, and the entire batch shares the same schema; status is returned independently for each table; when the address is not passed, the master is used by default"

#: backend/dbm_aiagent/mcp_tools/sqlserver/views.py:480
msgid ""
"批量查询 SQLServer 表上各索引的碎片状态（dm_db_index_physical_stats，LIMITED "
"模式扫描）；默认仅返回 page_count >= 1000 的索引（小索引碎片对性能基本无影"
"响）；用于辅助决策 REORGANIZE / REBUILD；tables 一次传 1~20 张表，整批共用同"
"一个 schema；每张表独立返回 status；address 不传时缺省走 master"
msgstr "Query the fragmentation status of each index on the SQL Server table in batches (dm_db_index_physical_stats, LIMITED mode scan); by default, only indexes with page_count &gt;= 1000 are returned (small index fragmentation has basically no impact on performance); used to assist decision-making REORGANIZE / REBUILD; tables transfer 1 to 20 tables at a time, and the entire batch shares the same schema; each table returns status independently; defaults to master when address is not transferred"

